  "comment": "The residual graph as exported from GGML (residual.workload.json beside this file, origin.kind=ggml), with the ACCEPTANCE.md 1 common costs: H2D 3 ms, MUL_MAT 2 ms, RELU/ADD 1 ms, workspace 0, reserve 0, alignment 1. Same scenario as examples/residual-cap160.json, bound to the real export instead of the fixture.",
  "architecture": {
    "dram_capacity_bytes": null,
    "vram_capacity_bytes": 160,
    "runtime_reserved_bytes": 0,
